# Tauqe runtime artifacts
#
# The whole state directory stays out of the repository: credentials, history,
# plans, reviews, mockups, cached documentation snapshots, and the transaction
# marker are runtime data, not sources. Nothing inside it is versioned, so the
# directory itself is re-included once and every path beneath it is ignored.
!.tauqe
.tauqe/*

# Transient file-operation siblings (staged writes and rollback backups)
*.tauqe-tmp
*.tauqe-bak

# mdBook build artifacts
docs/book/
